- [Calculations](../language/calculations_windows.malloynb) - Window functions (running totals, ranks, lag/lead)
- [Nested Views](../language/nesting.malloynb) - Subtables and multi-level analysis
- [Sources](../language/source.malloynb#sources-from-sql-queries) - Use raw SQL when you need database-specific features

**Common patterns:**
- [Percent of Total](../patterns/percent_of_total.malloynb)
- [Year-over-Year Comparisons](../patterns/yoy.malloynb)
- [Cohort Analysis](../patterns/cohorts.malloynb)

